# CONTEXT HANDOFF — DSV + n8n BUDDHIST CHANNEL

## 1. DSV — Dark Starve Valley

DSV là game 3D dark-fantasy farming RPG làm bằng Unreal Engine, C++ first.

Core:

* Farming
* Alchemy
* Relationships
* Choice / Consequence
* Combat
* Future: asymmetric co-op / NPC Possession

High concept:

* Player nhiễm cùng căn bệnh với NPC.
* Serum khan hiếm.
* Prototype: 6 seeds → 6 crops → craft tối đa 2 serum → 3 candidates (Player + NPC A + NPC B) → chỉ cứu được 2 → người không được cứu trở thành Boss.

Gameplay loop:
Explore → Gather → Farm → Alchemy → Interact → Choose → Relationship → Consequence → Combat/Romance/Story → Ending.

M4 prototype DoD:

* Infection
* Meet 2 NPCs
* Disease progression
* Plant 6 seeds
* Craft 2 serum
* Choose 2 of 3
* Relationship/consequence
* Unsaved candidate → Boss
* Combat
* Ending
* Checkpoint/reload
* Alternate route chỉ qua New Game

M4 Gate:

* Player hiểu mình bị nhiễm
* Hiểu chỉ có 2 serum
* Hiểu có 3 candidates
* Cảm thấy lựa chọn gây discomfort/regret
* Muốn xem alternative outcome
  Nếu M4 fail → stop expansion, fix core.

Roadmap:
P0 Foundation
P1 Character Architecture
P2 World Blockout
P3 Player Controller
P4 Disease/Survival
P5 Farming
P6 Alchemy
P7 NPC/Relationship
P8 Choice/Narrative
M4 Gate
P9 Transformation/Boss/Combat
P10 Checkpoint/UI
P15 Vertical Slice
P11 Art
P12 Cinematic/Adult Event
P13 Audio
P14 QA

Rules:

* WIP = 1
* Dependency first
* Relative SP
* No fixed deadline
* No scope expansion unless required by current task/DoD
* Workflow: Task → DoD → implement → test → done → next
* Không interrupt deep work bằng portfolio/marketing/documentation.
* Không build generic systems trước khi prototype chứng minh cần.

Current farming architecture:

* Character: input/action
* MainController: player-facing orchestration + UI routing
* FarmPlot: farming state/lifecycle
* Plant Actor: growth lifecycle
* PlayerState: inventory/item ownership
* UI: presentation/selection/result
* Plant Actor callback FarmPlot; FarmPlot quyết định harvest.
* Không build general inventory system cho M4.

Controller architecture:

* MainController là central orchestrator.
* Controller có thể callback objects và objects callback controller.
* Character không cần artificial intermediary.
* Controller nên orchestrate/route, không accumulate domain logic.
* Không refactor chỉ để giảm số API.
* Có thể tiến tới:
  BeginInteraction(FInteractionContext)
  → Controller
  → UI
  → CompleteInteraction(FInteractionResult)
  → source
* EItemType = item là gì.
* InteractionType/context = player đang làm gì với item đó trong context này.
* TMap có thể dùng cho routing nhẹ; không build giant lambda map/generic InteractionComponent quá sớm.

Technical principles:

* C++ first; Blueprint secondary (cosmetics/UI/presentation/implementation).
* Orthogonal state dimensions.
* Relevant system owns state authority.
* Explicit SaveGame structs/snapshots.
* Debug bằng FAutoConsoleCommand/debug subsystem.
* Compile != package != runtime.
* Event-based telemetry.
* Analytics/Steam integration để sau.
* Không build system trước khi prototype chứng minh cần.

