## 8. Alternatives to Telegram for approval

Possible channels:

* Telegram — best overall for this use case
* Discord — good for media-heavy content review
* Slack — good for team/workspace workflows
* Gmail/email — good for formal approval by email
* n8n Chat — possible
* Custom web dashboard — powerful but currently overkill

Architectural principle:
Approval should be a production stage, not tightly coupled to Telegram.

Long-term:
n8n → REVIEW
├→ Telegram
├→ Discord
├→ Gmail
└→ Web UI

Production state:
GENERATED
→ WAITING_APPROVAL
→ APPROVED / REJECTED
→ next generation/render/publish stage

But for current MVP, simply:
Verse → lyrics → image → Telegram

After end-to-end works, add approval.

